// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`R3.10 RngExplainer > R3.10 the explainer's content matches its snapshot: what earns Best, how the roll works, why practise mixing (ADR 0024) 1`] = `
<div
  class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-sm"
  data-testid="rng-explainer-content"
>
  <section
    class="flex flex-col gap-2"
  >
    <h3
      class="font-semibold"
    >
      Why randomize at all
    </h3>
    <p>
      Some hands play more than one action, for example calling some of the time and raising the rest. A hand that mixes is indifferent between those actions: each one earns the same EV (expected value) by itself.
    </p>
    <p>
      The mix matters for your range as a whole. If you always played this hand the same way, an observant opponent could learn which hands take which line and play against that.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section
    class="flex flex-col gap-2"
  >
    <h3
      class="font-semibold"
    >
      How the roll works
    </h3>
    <p>
      Before you act, the app rolls a number from 1 to 100. Your hand's actions are lined up from passive to aggressive: fold, then check or call, then bets and raises from small to large. Each action gets a band as wide as its frequency, and the roll picks the action whose band contains it. That action is labeled Best.
    </p>
    <p>
      Example: 40 percent call and 60 percent raise means rolls 1 to 40 call and 41 to 100 raise. Here the roll is 37, so it lands in the call band.
    </p>
    <div
      class="flex flex-col gap-2"
      data-selected-index="0"
      data-testid="rng-roller"
    >
      <div
        class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"
      >
        <p
          aria-live="polite"
          class="text-sm font-medium"
        >
          Roll 37 selects Call
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative"
      >
        <ol
          aria-label="RNG bands"
          class="flex h-12 w-full overflow-hidden rounded border border-border"
        >
          <li
            aria-current="true"
            class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 overflow-hidden border-r border-black/20 px-1 text-xs text-slate-900 bg-(--action-light) dark:bg-(--action-dark) outline outline-2 -outline-offset-2 outline-focus"
            data-action-index="0"
            data-range="1-40"
            style="--action-light: #4ade80; --action-dark: #22c55e; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 1px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 5px 5px; width: 40%;"
            title="1-40 Call"
          >
            <span
              class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate rounded bg-white/80 px-1"
            >
              <span
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="inline-block h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-sm border border-black/20 bg-(--action-light) dark:bg-(--action-dark)"
                  data-pattern="dots"
                  data-testid="action-swatch"
                  style="--action-light: #4ade80; --action-dark: #22c55e; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 1px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 5px 5px;"
                />
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="font-mono text-xs font-bold"
                >
                  C
                </span>
              </span>
              <span
                data-testid="rng-band-label"
              >
                1-40 Call
              </span>
            </span>
          </li>
          <li
            class="flex min-w-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 overflow-hidden border-r border-black/20 px-1 text-xs text-slate-900 bg-(--action-light) dark:bg-(--action-dark)"
            data-action-index="1"
            data-range="41-100"
            style="--action-light: #f87171; --action-dark: #ef4444; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0 2px, transparent 2px 6px); width: 60%;"
            title="41-100 Raise to 2.5bb"
          >
            <span
              class="flex items-center gap-1 truncate rounded bg-white/80 px-1"
            >
              <span
                class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"
              >
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="inline-block h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-sm border border-black/20 bg-(--action-light) dark:bg-(--action-dark)"
                  data-pattern="diagonal"
                  data-testid="action-swatch"
                  style="--action-light: #f87171; --action-dark: #ef4444; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0 2px, transparent 2px 6px);"
                />
                <span
                  aria-hidden="true"
                  class="font-mono text-xs font-bold"
                >
                  R
                </span>
              </span>
              <span
                data-testid="rng-band-label"
              >
                41-100 Raise to 2.5bb
              </span>
            </span>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <span
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="absolute -top-1 -bottom-1 w-0.5 -translate-x-1/2 bg-text"
          data-testid="rng-marker"
          style="left: 36.5%;"
        />
      </div>
      <ul
        aria-label="RNG band legend"
        class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted"
      >
        <li
          class="flex items-center gap-1"
        >
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"
          >
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="inline-block h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-sm border border-black/20 bg-(--action-light) dark:bg-(--action-dark)"
              data-pattern="dots"
              data-testid="action-swatch"
              style="--action-light: #4ade80; --action-dark: #22c55e; background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 1px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 5px 5px;"
            />
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="font-mono text-xs font-bold"
            >
              C
            </span>
          </span>
          <span>
            1-40 Call
          </span>
        </li>
        <li
          class="flex items-center gap-1"
        >
          <span
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1"
          >
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="inline-block h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0 rounded-sm border border-black/20 bg-(--action-light) dark:bg-(--action-dark)"
              data-pattern="diagonal"
              data-testid="action-swatch"
              style="--action-light: #f87171; --action-dark: #ef4444; background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 0 2px, transparent 2px 6px);"
            />
            <span
              aria-hidden="true"
              class="font-mono text-xs font-bold"
            >
              R
            </span>
          </span>
          <span>
            41-100 Raise to 2.5bb
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p
      class="text-muted"
    >
      You see only the roll before you act. The bands appear after your decision, because they are the hand's strategy.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section
    class="flex flex-col gap-2"
  >
    <h3
      class="font-semibold"
    >
      Why it is optional
    </h3>
    <p>
      Against opponents who do not track your frequencies, getting the action category right (fold, call or raise) matters more than hitting the exact mix.
    </p>
    <p>
      Grading stays fair either way: any action in your hand's mix whose EV loss is within the noise floor is graded correct, with or without RNG mode.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
`;
